    "detailed_description": "<strong>Defend yourself from hordes of undead skeletons in Hunchback's Dungeon, an action-roguelite arena shooter! You play as a deformed, magic-wielding human. Unlock new characters and difficulties, collect unique items, equip powerful spells, and survive until the end.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong> Become an ultimate spell caster, wielding up to 4 unique and powerful spells at the same time. The list of spells available in the game is growing;</strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369520/extras/c61565f824c7cd7269da9e42db9c3e83.poster.avif?t=1747133421\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369520/extras/c61565f824c7cd7269da9e42db9c3e83.webm?t=1747133421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369520/extras/c61565f824c7cd7269da9e42db9c3e83.mp4?t=1747133421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong> Really fast runs (20-30 minutes);</strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369520/extras/b601a5c7c96edeec4c12715ae55cf8b9.poster.avif?t=1747133421\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369520/extras/b601a5c7c96edeec4c12715ae55cf8b9.webm?t=1747133421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369520/extras/b601a5c7c96edeec4c12715ae55cf8b9.mp4?t=1747133421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong> Unlock new characters, difficulties and items;</strong></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autopl